# Drop corporate CA .crt files in this directory before building the
# coder-server image. They get installed into the image's trust store
# (update-ca-certificates → /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt) so httpx
# / openai-sdk / curl trust enterprise-CA-signed endpoints like
# dgx-cluster.trad.int.
#
# .crt files here are gitignored — they're org infrastructure, not source.
# The Dockerfile COPYs this whole directory at build time; an empty
# directory produces an image with no extra trust (the default).
